  {
   "id": "e203",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 10,
   "y": 768.0,
   "width": 1273.0,
   "height": 75.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1953731525,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 834374148,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "DeepSeek-V3: 576 * 2 B * 61 = 70,272 B = 68.6 KiB/token. The same model as plain MHA would cache 2*61*128*128*2 B = 3.8 MiB/token (57x more).\nA 671B-parameter MLA model caches LESS per token than an 8B GQA model (68.6 vs 128 KiB): architecture beats size for KV.\nLayer-mix designs cut the T-growing part:  Gemma-3 = 5 local (1,024-token window) : 1 global layer;  Jamba = 1 attention : 7 Mamba layers;\nQwen3-Next = 3 Gated-DeltaNet : 1 gated-attention layer  ->  only 1/6, 1/8, 1/4 of layers keep a KV cache that grows with T.",
   "originalText": "DeepSeek-V3: 576 * 2 B * 61 = 70,272 B = 68.6 KiB/token. The same model as plain MHA would cache 2*61*128*128*2 B = 3.8 MiB/token (57x more).\nA 671B-parameter MLA model caches LESS per token than an 8B GQA model (68.6 vs 128 KiB): architecture beats size for KV.\nLayer-mix designs cut the T-growing part:  Gemma-3 = 5 local (1,024-token window) : 1 global layer;  Jamba = 1 attention : 7 Mamba layers;\nQwen3-Next = 3 Gated-DeltaNet : 1 gated-attention layer  ->  only 1/6, 1/8, 1/4 of layers keep a KV cache that grows with T.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e202",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
