   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "e307",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1570,
   "y": 1838.0,
   "width": 751.0,
   "height": 93.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 471561267,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1603487569,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "MHA shape for Llama-3-70B: 2 * 80 * 64 * 128 * 2 B = 2,621,440 B = 2.5 MiB / token.\nMLA: 70,272 B * 32,768 = 2.30e9 B = 2.15 GiB.   FP8 KV halves S: 1.07 GiB.\nThis is KV ONLY: DeepSeek-V3 weights (671B params, ~671 GB in FP8) need a\nmulti-GPU node, Llama-3-70B ~140 GB in BF16. Compare per KV budget, not per GPU.\nBatch size = concurrency = throughput: 9 -> 43 -> 86 chats in the same 100 GB.",
   "originalText": "MHA shape for Llama-3-70B: 2 * 80 * 64 * 128 * 2 B = 2,621,440 B = 2.5 MiB / token.\nMLA: 70,272 B * 32,768 = 2.30e9 B = 2.15 GiB.   FP8 KV halves S: 1.07 GiB.\nThis is KV ONLY: DeepSeek-V3 weights (671B params, ~671 GB in FP8) need a\nmulti-GPU node, Llama-3-70B ~140 GB in BF16. Compare per KV budget, not per GPU.\nBatch size = concurrency = throughput: 9 -> 43 -> 86 chats in the same 100 GB.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e306",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e308",
