   "text": "Snapshot of public configs and papers as of 2025-26: verify a model card before quoting its numbers in production.\nThe constant across all of it: KV bytes = 2 * L * B * T * H_kv * d_h * S. Every SOTA tool attacks one term, its placement, or how fast it is read.",
